.vscode/

# The coverage report is a measurement of one build of one commit. Its line numbers are that
# commit's, so a copy kept in the tree drifts the moment a line moves and reports coverage for
# lines that are no longer there. It is generated in the run that uploads it and never committed.
coverage.xml

# gcov's per-object notes and counts, written beside the objects a coverage build produces.
*.gcda
*.gcno
*.gcov

# The coverage build directory, which the CI workflow puts inside the workspace.
build-cov/
